      "widgets_values": [
        "Latent Sculptor: SIShadowHighlight\n\nThis is your digital darkroom curve.\n\nhighlight_amount (Default 0.3):\n\nPush to 0.6 \u2013 0.8: Tests if FLUX highlights blow out or remain rich and textured.\n\nshadow_amount (Default 0.0):\n\nTry -0.25: Deepens the blacks (crushed luxury editorial look).\n\nTry +0.30: Shadow recovery / lifts dark wool coats so texture doesn't get lost in shadow."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        518.9548494586032,
        678.3032484631726
      ],
      "size": [
        377.30222997047383,
        116.72109243342459
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "FLUX guidance (in Conditioning / Clip Text)\n\n2.0 \u2013 2.5: More photographic, softer transitions, yields more authority to the 3D lit plate.\n\n3.5 \u2013 4.5: High prompt adherence; enhances hard edges, but can introduce digital sharpness."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -834.1017420865142,
