      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Pass 1 split_step \n\nStep 8 / 30: Geometry is still fluid; lighting creates massive volumetric shifts.\n\nStep 10 / 30 (Calibrated Default): Shape locked, surface shading 100% receptive.\n\nStep 15 / 30: Geometry locked tight; lighting acts purely on micro-surfaces."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
